      "versionNonce": 1201741472,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Offline on Welcome: the buttons are disabled, with the reason\n• A likely typo: \"Did you mean …?\" fills it in; it never blocks\n• While it works: \"Sending…\" and \"Checking…\", so nothing is sent twice\n• Offline after sending: the code can be typed, and is kept\n• Every screen after Send link reads the same whether or not the address has an account",
      "originalText": "• Offline on Welcome: the buttons are disabled, with the reason\n• A likely typo: \"Did you mean …?\" fills it in; it never blocks\n• While it works: \"Sending…\" and \"Checking…\", so nothing is sent twice\n• Offline after sending: the code can be typed, and is kept\n• Every screen after Send link reads the same whether or not the address has an account",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
